/*
# ConnectMuslim — Manchester Launch Seed Data

## What this migration does
Populates the database with a focused Manchester dataset so the platform is
genuinely useful to a first visitor in one city, addressing the cold-start
problem. This is the "pre-launch manual content" the launch strategy calls for:
directories that look useful before any users sign up.

## Data seeded (Manchester-focused)
1. Communities (11 default category groups) — general interest groups.
2. Mosques (35) — Manchester-area mosques across neighbourhoods (Cheetham Hill,
   Rusholme, Longsight, Moss Side, Salford, Oldham, Stockport, etc.).
3. Businesses (50) — Muslim-owned businesses across categories: halal
   restaurants, butchers, grocery, accountancy, bookstores, tutors, barbers,
   pharmacies, Islamic schools, and services. A handful are verified/featured.
4. Events (20) — upcoming Manchester events across categories over the next
   few weeks. A few are featured.
5. Jobs (15) — Manchester-area jobs and volunteering roles. A few featured.
6. News (4) — community announcements relevant to Manchester Muslims.

## Important notes
- All inserts use ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING so re-running is safe.
- Community slugs are auto-generated by the trg_generate_community_slug trigger.
- Job posted_by and event creator_id are left NULL (no user account at seed time).
- Addresses use plausible Manchester postcodes/districts.
- is_verified/is_featured/is_sponsored flags are set on a subset to surface the
  organisation revenue model visually from day one.
*/

-- ============================================================
-- 1. COMMUNITIES (11 default category groups)
-- ============================================================
ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;

-- ============================================================
-- 2. MOSQUES (35 Manchester-area mosques)
-- ============================================================
ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;

-- ============================================================
-- 3. BUSINESSES (50 Muslim-owned Manchester businesses)
-- ============================================================
ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;

